# The whole repository is pinned to LF on checkout (see AGENTS.md, "Code conventions"):
# raw multiline C# string literals take the line endings of the source file, and the WSL-bound
# scripts built from them must stay LF — a CRLF checkout once put \r into every script the
# guard sends into the distros (bash dies on the first line while wsl.exe still exits 0).
# Binary files are auto-detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
